# These artifacts must stay strict JSON (the JSON-compatible YAML 1.2 profile
# required by the SDD-010 participation design) so they remain parseable by the
# zero-dependency validators and by master YAML tooling. Prettier-style
# auto-formatters expand JSON into YAML-ish layouts with trailing commas, which
# breaks the strict-JSON contract. Excluded here so no tool reformats them.
capability-manifest.yaml
docs/architecture/program-lock-facts.json
